More than 60 professionals worked on the project, coordinated by Leticia Álvarez (editorial), José Ángel Esteban (audio) and Sara I Belled (narrative, design).

The main narrative is made up of the stories narrated and documented by the professionals of El Correo, El Diario Vasco, El Diario Montañés, La Verdad, Ideal, Hoy, Sur, La Rioja, El Norte de Castilla, El Comercio, Las Provincias and la Agencia Colpisa.

